  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "水族館（屋内）",
    "id": "2054",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「デート、デート♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「珍しく浮かれちゃってるの。こんなにデートらしいデートははじめてなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしの友達はひびきんぐやみづきちゃんだから、だいたい変なところに行くことが多いの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ひびきんぐは海やプールにばかり連れて行くし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「こないだなんか、みづきちゃんに呼び出されて、近くの人形館に連れていかれたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「普通の買い物やレジャースポットから、少し離れてるというか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ふたりとも、趣味が趣味だから、どうしてもオカルト関係や水辺みたいなところになるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「でも、水族館だけは特別。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「子供のころに家族と来たことを思い出すから、自然と楽しくなっちゃうの☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「なんだか、こうやって手を繋いでると、お兄ちゃんに手を引かれてるみたいなの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「大きくて、暖かい手なの……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「って、なんで普通に手を繋いでるの!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「前々から、おいしい役回りだと思ってたけど。ここまで来ると天性の才能なの……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そもそも君咲学院はじめての男子生徒ってだけでも役得なのに、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「バレンタインやクリスマスにもいろいろあったって時国さんから聞いたの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そういうのはいけないの！　学院の風紀を乱してるの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「きっと風紀委員の瀬川さんも黙ってないの……うぅ、想像しただけで鳥肌が立つの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「とはいえ、こういうのも悪い気分はしないし、せっかくだから手を繋いだままにしておくの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「『一日限定カップル』みたいな感じで楽しむの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あっ、見て見て、お魚さんの群れなの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「すごくきれいなの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あっちには大きなウツボがいるの♪　意外とかわいい顔してるの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「たしか、ここの水族館のイベントにイルカショーがあったの。あとで観にいくの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……なんだかわたしばかり盛り上がっちゃってるみたいで、申し訳ないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ううっ、面白くない女でごめんなさいなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そうだよね、転校生くんの周りには、もっとおしゃべりできて雰囲気のいい女の子なんていっぱいいるはずなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「こういうのはじめてだから、浮かれすぎちゃって気付かなかったの……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしなんかが出る幕じゃなかったの～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ぐすん、ぐすん……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「って、いけないいけない。ちょっとネガティブになっちゃったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「頑張って楽しませるから、ついてきてほしいの……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしの事前調査によると、この先には購買コーナーがあって、そこでぬいぐるみを売ってるみたいなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「時国さんとお揃いのものを買ってもよかったのだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あいにく時国さんには『すぺりあん』っていう大事なぬいぐるみ……もとい、友達がいるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「だから、自分のものだけ今日買ってしまうの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「転校生くん。せっかくだから『すぺりあん』が何なのか教えてほしいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あの謎の生物っぽさ、やっぱり未確認生命体？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「うーん。転校生くんにもわからないみたいなの。よけいに謎が深まるの……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「今度会ったときに、直接聞いてみようかな……？」"
